       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 2000 mg three times daily is 6000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3000 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 2000 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 1000 mg. A dose this size risks hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nHere are some options:\n1. **Standard dosing:** 1000 mg by mouth three times daily (3000 mg/day). I could also do 1000 mg four times daily (4000 mg/day), but that is the ceiling.\n2. **650 mg by mouth every 6 hours:** This totals 2600 mg/day.\n3. **Your original order:** If 2000 mg three times daily is intentional and I've misread it, tell me and I'll enter it with a note on the clinical rationale.\n\nWhich would you like me to enter?"
